  "global_rules": [
    "A documented directory is not an activated Rust crate.",
    "Workspace members activate incrementally in implementation dependency order and never merely reserve final topology names.",
    "Every fact result relation effect artifact session release and installation record binds exact identities profiles generations digests provenance coverage conflicts and required nonclaims.",
    "Candidate Possible Partial Conflict Truncated Cancelled Failed OutcomeUnknown ResynchronizationRequired and NotEvaluated never become proof clean Negative complete or pass.",
    "Clean absence requires exact owner negative authority over complete relevant coverage with no blocker.",
    "EmmyLua is the sole correctness-path Lua parser and is isolated behind one updateable compatibility-probed adapter.",
    "Repository addon TOC XML Lua archive provider and client input is bounded and nonexecuting.",
    "Reference user project Blizzard UI calibration external provider runtime editor overlay history and release installation universes remain separate.",
    "Production recognizers are universal structural rules and never branch on repository addon owner path popularity labels splits reviews holdouts canaries providers or models.",
    "Similarity rank score top sole repetition provider labels stable external state and zero results remain Candidate signals and never create exact or negative authority.",
    "Metrics graph validity review authorization holdout authorization submission signature publication canary activation rollout distribution installation and runtime correctness are independent gates.",
    "Only exact source owners map external locators and ExactMapped proves locator identity only.",
    "External candidate selection is explicit caller intent and is not verification acceptance edit authorization lineage replacement impact or promotion.",
    "Provider metadata remains a separate Candidate sidecar and never enters ContextSemanticPack truth.",
    "Provider failure is lane-local and never degrades exact local capabilities.",
    "Service operation registries protocol profiles and schemas are closed versioned content-addressed and may only be narrowed at runtime.",
    "Applications transports and internal tools depend on wow-service only among framework crates and invoke one service operation per semantic request.",
    "Every externally observable or durable effect registers OperationId plus CanonicalRequestDigest before dispatch.",
    "Response loss never proves no effect and OutcomeUnknown blocks blind repetition until exact reconciliation.",
    "No public success precedes required validation read-back retention audit and reverse-order resource closure.",
    "Source build lockfile toolchain target features dependencies build scripts environment deterministic profile and executor are exact release inputs.",
    "At least two independent unsigned builds are required for a reproducibility claim.",
    "SBOM provenance license notices checksums test reports signatures bundle support and update manifests are independent immutable release artifacts.",
    "Baseline updates are explicit and staged with verified backup migration current CAS self-check LastKnownRunnable and rollback.",
    "Support claims are limited to exact tested target OS protocol store schema data-pack WoW-profile client feature and resource matrices.",
    "Sensitive review holdout signing provider build distribution deployment installation and CI material never enters repository public configuration fixtures logs bundles or canonical results.",
    "There is no generic shell script plugin model tool RPC SQL provider API installer or callback escape hatch.",
    "Baseline performs no hidden current discovery network update check download install telemetry crash upload or remote configuration.",
    "Missing implementation adapter probe benchmark platform client runtime signing provider installation or checksum evidence is blocked or NotEvaluated never pass.",
    "No CI or release workflow is added until real frozen commands exist and an explicit owner and launch gate require it.",
    "After E7-B the default next work is I0-A wow-core implementation; new architecture requires a concrete implementation-discovered contract failure and the smallest tested seam or ADR change."
  ],
